loc.STATE_FOOD_SECURITY_TOOLTIP:
#header [concept_starvation] in [State.GetCountry.GetFlagTextIcon] [State.GetName]#!
[State.GetFoodSecurity.GetNumStarvingPops|D-] ([State.GetFoodSecurity.GetPercentageStarvingPops|%0-]) [Concept('concept_pop', '$concept_pops$')] are $concept_starving$
$TOOLTIP_DELIMITER$
@mild_starvation! [State.GetFoodSecurity.GetNumStarvingPopsMild|D-] ([State.GetFoodSecurity.GetPercentageStarvingPopsMild|%0-]) are in $concept_mild_starvation$
@severe_starvation! [State.GetFoodSecurity.GetNumStarvingPopsSevere|D-] ([State.GetFoodSecurity.GetPercentageStarvingPopsSevere|%0-]) are in $concept_severe_starvation$[ConcatIfNeitherEmpty('

', AddLocalizationIf(State.HasFamine, State.GetFamineDesc))]
